<title>HUNGARY: FOTEX GROUP 1996 IAS NET INCOME 511.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>FOTEX GROUP 1996 IAS NET INCOME 511.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Jan-Dec 1996   Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating  profit	  1,053.4   vs  1,135.5</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		 738.7   vs  1,115.1</p>
<p>    Group net income		     511.3   vs    851.5</p>
<p>    Group net sales		   37,137.8   vs 35,043.1</p>
<p>    Costs of sales		    25,092.0   vs  24,987.6</p>
<p>    Gross profit			12,045.9   vs  10,055.6</p>
<p>    Costs				 10,992.5   vs   8,920.1</p>
<p>    Net other income		  184.2 loss vs  283.6 profit</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   24.3 profit vs 40.0 loss</p>
<p>    Minority interest		 (-)109.7   vs  (-)263.9</p>
<p>    Taxation				 272.4   vs     263.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Fotex group is a diversified retailer.</p>
<p>The figures are consolidated, they were prepared in</p>
<p>accordance with International Accounting Standards. The 1996</p>
<p>are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
